sentences.text:
The above referred Welfare / Health Officers who have appeared for interview had stated that;
based on the complaints received regarding deterioration of public health, direct field inspection has been conducted, proper notive have been sent and precautionary measures have been taken so that residents of that area http://www.judis.nic.in are not affected due to deterioration of public health;
letters have been sent to the concerned Food Safety Officer, Revenue Divisional Officer for taking necessary action and further continuous action is being taken; notice under Section 235, 236, 249,
250 r/w 313 of Tamil Nadu District Municipalities Act 1920 have been sent to Thiru.A.Samad and Thiru.M.Sardar; and submitted copy of letter dated 19.02.2019 sent to the Revenue Divisional Officer, copy of letter dated 19.02.2019 sent to the Food Safety Officer, Kancheepuram.
